{"meta":{"id":"file-structure","category":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux","title":"파일 구성","subtitle":"(Rocky Linux)","summary":"DNF/RPM 관련 경로를 포함한 디렉터리 구조","tags":["리눅스","로키리눅스","rocky linux","파일시스템","dnf"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-files","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-50 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>\n      로키 리눅스 2\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Linux Basics</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    파일 구성 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-teal-600 font-serif\">(Rocky Linux)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 표준 FHS 위에 얹힌 DNF/RPM, SELinux 관련 경로 정리\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">RHEL 계열도 표준 FHS를 따르며, RPM 기반 특유의 경로가 일부 추가됨</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">저장소 설정은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">/etc/yum.repos.d/</code>에 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.repo</code> 파일 형태로 저장됨</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">SELinux 정책 관련 설정은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">/etc/selinux/</code>에서 관리됨</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">주요 디렉터리 구성 & 역할</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">RHEL 계열 특화 경로 포함</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[46%]\">구분 및 경로</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[20%]\">접근 권한</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[34%]\">핵심 역할</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[DNF]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/etc/yum.repos.d</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">root</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">DNF/YUM 저장소 설정 파일 모음</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[DNF]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/var/log/dnf.log</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">시스템</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">패키지 설치/업데이트 로그</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-cyan-700 bg-cyan-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[보안]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/etc/selinux</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">root</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">SELinux 정책/모드 설정</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-violet-700 bg-violet-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[공통]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/home/사용자명</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">사용자별</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">개인 파일, 사용자별 설정</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-violet-700 bg-violet-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[공통]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/usr/lib/systemd</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">시스템</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">systemd 서비스 유닛 파일 저장</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">알아두면 좋은 점</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">rpm -ql 패키지명</code>으로 특정 패키지가 설치한 파일 목록을 확인할 수 있습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서비스가 실행되지 않을 땐 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">SELinux/firewalld 설정</strong>부터 의심해보는 것이 좋습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서비스 로그는 파일이 아니라 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">journalctl</code>로 조회하는 경우가 많습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Linux Basics Guide</span>\n  <span>Rocky Linux</span>\n</div>\n","path":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux/file-structure","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"linux","title":"리눅스","path":"it/linux"},{"id":"linux-types","title":"리눅스 종류","path":"it/linux/linux-types"},{"id":"rocky-linux","title":"로키 리눅스 (Rocky Linux)","path":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux"}],"hasImage":false}